cases.good:
// Content-script MutationObserver on document.body detects <video> replacement
// Track hasSeenFirstVideo: first mount = baseline (no signal),
// subsequent <video> replacement = episode switch → send VIDEO_EPISODE_CHANGED
// Quality switch keeps same element (sameElement: true) → no signal → subtitles preserved
// Background handler reuses clear methods (same as onTabUpdated loading)
// Replacement fires BEFORE new media detects → clear runs first → no race
